---
/*
  Structure only, written from scratch rather than from a generator template.
  The seven required parts come from 04-konzept.md section 4.3, "/imprint und
  /privacy". Everything that needs a legal decision or a real processor name is
  marked TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL in the copy.

  Two hard points from the concept that must survive review:
  1. The recipient list names only services that actually see data.
  2. A retention period written here has to be executed, not just printed.
*/
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { legal } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy | Wunder"
  description="What data this site collects, who receives it, and how long it is kept."
  noindex
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>

      <p class="draft-note">
        Draft structure. The wording on this page is not legally reviewed yet. Items marked TO BE
        COMPLETED BY COUNSEL must be filled and the whole page confirmed before it goes live. The
        old generator template is deliberately not carried over.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Controller</h2>
      <p>
        {legal.company}, {legal.street}, {legal.city}, {legal.country}. Registration number {
          legal.regNumber
        }.<br />
        Data protection contact: <a href={`mailto:${legal.privacyEmail}`}>{legal.privacyEmail}</a>
      </p>
      <p class="todo">
        TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: whether a data protection officer is required for this entity,
        and if so, the contact details.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Recipients</h2>
      <p>
        Only services that actually see data in the website and application path are listed here. No
        precautionary list.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Hosting: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED, EU region, processing agreement in place</span></li>
        <li>Form backend: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED</span></li>
        <li>Database: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED</span></li>
        <li>Customer relationship system: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED</span></li>
        <li>Appointment booking: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED</span></li>
        <li>Email: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED</span></li>
        <li>Analytics: <span class="todo">TO BE CONFIRMED, cookieless and aggregate only</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="todo">
        TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: the legal wording per recipient, including the processing
        agreement reference.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Transfers outside the European Union</h2>
      <p class="todo">
        TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: every recipient and every part of the team outside the European
        Union, each with the transfer instrument it relies on. The content and chat team works
        outside the European Union and belongs in this section.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Legal bases</h2>
      <p class="todo">
        TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: the legal basis per processing activity under European and
        Latvian law. The previous text argued from German employment law, which does not apply to
        this controller and must not come back.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Applications</h2>
      <p>
        Creator applications and job applications are handled separately, with different fields,
        different readers and different retention periods.
      </p>
      <h3>Creator applications</h3>
      <p>
        Fields collected: Instagram handle, link to your OnlyFans or link page, country of tax
        residency, whether you are currently under contract and until when, a revenue band, a
        publishing frequency band, your email address and an optional free text note.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not collect identity documents, photographs, bank details or login credentials, and we
        do not accept file uploads through this site.
      </p>
      <p class="todo">
        TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: purpose, readers, retention period and deletion routine. The
        retention period stated here has to be executed as a real deletion job.
      </p>
      <h3>Job applications</h3>
      <p class="todo">
        TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: the careers path is a separate system and has to be described
        separately, including its own recipients and retention.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can request access, correction, deletion, restriction and portability of your data, and
        you can object to processing. You can also complain to the Latvian supervisory authority,
        the Data State Inspectorate.
      </p>
      <p class="todo">TO BE COMPLETED BY COUNSEL: the exact wording and the authority contact details.</p>

      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no cookies. There is no tracking pixel, no session recording, no heatmap and
        no cross site identifier, which is why there is no consent banner asking you to agree to
        any of it.
      </p>
      <p>
        If analytics are switched on, they are cookieless and aggregate. We cannot tell who visited
        a page, and we do not want to be able to.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .draft-note {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-top: 44px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    text-transform: none;
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .todo {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
